WEBVTT

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:09.770
Let's go!

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.110
One, two!

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.950
Thank you for the food!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.260
This is all I could manage to get.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:42.890
It's barely enough to patch the holes in the walls.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:46.240
I intended to get a lot more.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.060
Please forgive me!

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:53.190
Did you sneak into the count's castle,

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:54.660
Risty-san?

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.030
The count has so much treasure!

00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:59.910
It's a thief's number one goal!

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:03.620
After meeting the Lightning General, I had to ditch the loot,

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:06.510
but I really intended to bring it back to you all!

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.710
They have such hypocritical morals.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.750
I'm sick of them getting away with it.

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.900
Risty-san...

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:25.930
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:25.930
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:25.930
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:34.650
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:34.650
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:34.650
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:50.650
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:50.650
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:50.650
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:57.170
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:57.170
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:57.170
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:02.840
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:02.840
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:02.840
It is now my wish to become strong

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:09.470
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:09.470
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:09.470
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:15.640
kotae wo shiritai

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:15.640
答えを知りたい

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:15.640
I want to know the answer

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:22.530
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:22.530
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:22.530
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:28.780
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:28.780
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:28.780
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:34.960
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:34.960
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:34.960
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:45.060
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:45.060
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:45.060
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.190
Try saying that again.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.300
I'll say it as many time as you like.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.840
How do you intend to feed those children with so little food?

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:02.250
There isn't enough to go around, so it can't be helped.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:04.410
What about charity?

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:05.680
Huh?

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:09.540
Count Bansu's family aids the poor by way of charities.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:14.980
Hey, hey. Why would Count Bansu give anyone money?

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.450
To protect the people.

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:19.210
That is my parents' duty.

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.550
You should stop saying things like that.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:29.490
I understand that it may be hard for you to believe,

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:34.560
but you need to open your eyes and witness the true state of this city.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.540
This is the first time you've seen the slums?

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:49.200
Count Bansu's family isn't particularly evil,

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:52.160
it's just that all royalty is the same no matter where you go.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.550
The strong will obtain everything.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.670
That is the continental rule.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.290
That's just the way it is.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:00.760
Bye bye!

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.300
See ya later!

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:12.310
Hello?

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:15.940
I told you I'd take you all the way to the border...

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.840
Is it really okay to stop here?

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:22.780
As the future countess of the Bansu family, you can make fair laws and create prosperity.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.100
That doesn't sound so bad.

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:27.780
But that's only if you can be satisfied with that kind of life.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.780
What should I do?

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:32.470
Are you having a personal dilemma?

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:35.090
I bet you're thinking about some pretty deep stuff.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:38.560
It doesn't matter to me, but I'm taking the money you promised me.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.340
Even if you decide to return on your own.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.340
Don't act all high and mighty!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:46.880
You think I'm useless, but you can't even fix one roof by yourself!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:47.970
Queen's Blade.

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:48.800
Eh?

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:53.640
If you can win the Queen's Blade competition, you will obtain both money and power.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:59.040
When I was a kid, the nobles fought over the land, and I lost my parents because of it.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.140
I was constantly wavering between life and death.

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.150
Those painful memories...

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:08.570
I don't want anyone else to experience that.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:15.790
I will win Queen's Blade, and save those children.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.220
The strong will obtain everything.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:24.090
If that is the continental law, then I will become stronger than anyone else.

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:26.720
That is my way of living.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:28.790
I...

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:31.890
I'm ashamed of myself.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.310
Don't worry about it.

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:37.730
Don't just stand around, let's get going!

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:39.530
Thank you.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:40.270
Ah?

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:43.320
I didn't know anything.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.190
I didn't even know what to do.

00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:47.700
So, um...

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:50.070
I believe it was a good thing that I met you.

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:54.130
Nobles shouldn't bow their heads like that!

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:58.040
Also, I don't remember doing anything but escorting you!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.670
Don't just do things like that with no warning!

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:04.340
You totally ruined my mood.

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:09.680
I'm kind of hungry now.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:12.050
Didn't you just eat something?

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.980
Warriors, the warriors, where are the warriors!?

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.020
Wait, where am I?

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:24.090
Nanael is lost!

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.960
For crying out loud!!

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:56.600
Who's there?

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.810
What the hell?

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.980
And they're supposedly protecting this country...

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:30.070
<i>I will...</i>

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.960
<i>protect this country.</i>

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.510
Good evening!

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:38.610
H-Hey, hold on!

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:40.850
Just wait a second!

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:46.940
Shizuka-san?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.480
Tomoe-sama!

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:52.820
Priestess?

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.060
Oh warrior priestess?

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:57.280
Warrior priestess!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.750
I'm bored, I'm bored, I'm really bored!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.420
Um...

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.940
Tomoe-sama is in having an important discussion right now.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.470
I won't allow you to disturb her.

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.430
An important discussion?

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.350
Ah, is it about Queen's Blade?

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:29.650
It's about choosing the next warrior priestesses to participate in becoming the Queen of the mainland, right?

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.970
How do you know this?

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:32.970
I have inside information!

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:34.950
As I thought, it'll be Tomoe-sama, right?

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.370
Hey, are you going to accompany her?

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:42.530
If you don't, I wonder If I should go instead...

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:44.240
Just kidding!

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:50.530
Isn't there something cold and delicious on the mainland called 'ice cream'?

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.390
Come on, say something!

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:55.720
I do not speak with Demonic Ninja.

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:57.180
Damn.

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:01.310
It's <i>former</i> Demonic Ninja, though...

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:07.310
Though we are warrior priestesses, we will not be helping you on your journey in any way.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:12.760
You are entering the Queen's Blade competition of your own volition.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:15.280
You have permission to do so.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.520
The young Empress is being controlled by the corrupted officials

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.570
who ruined the country with their governance.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:25.090
The only ones that can protect and save this country now...

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:26.750
are warrior priestesses.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:31.980
I will show that I am worthy to protect this country from our enemies.

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.500
I am determined to do this.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:38.370
After winning Queen's Blade and becoming the mainland Queen,

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.400
use your newfound power to remove the traitors from our country.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.250
This is our plan.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:43.970
Yes.

00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:49.600
You will be marked as a traitor to the country and to Her Majesty for doing this.

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:51.310
I am prepared for that.

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.220
We do not know the mainland's terrain,

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:56.860
nor are we aware of the strength of the western warriors.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:00.600
It is hard to say if your journey will revive the lands of Hinomoto{fscx200}-

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.910
I will become the sword that protects Hinomoto.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:07.500
Since that is the fate of those that are warrior priestesses...

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:11.450
I will now perform the cleansing ceremony.

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:13.250
I shall be departing at dawn.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.340
You will also be given the Holy Sword,

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:19.200
a gift from the Empress.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:20.340
The Empress?

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.390
Thank you very much.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.930
Well then, it's in our storage...

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.520
Please wait a moment!

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:39.240
What is it?

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.870
I hope you're ready...

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.110
They're coming.

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:44.580
Just what is coming?

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.370
The Demonic Ninja Clan!

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:58.250
The preparations are going smoothly.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:58.590
Hmm...

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:02.470
Is anything going on? {Could this be Nanimoto, a name?}

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:04.930
Well, if it isn't the Empress.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:08.990
The moutains are burning, and yet we...

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:10.830
Can we only sit and watch?

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:14.400
Have you forgotten about the separation of church and state?

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:17.070
<i>Tomoe...</i>

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:19.440
<i>Please live, and revive Hinomoto!</i>

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.310
Shizuka, huh?

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.710
What can one little failure do?

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.460
Demonic Ninja Clan, depart.

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:41.260
Yes, sir!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:56.980
Shit!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.110
The fugitive has been located.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.400
Tomoe.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.030
Ah! So annoying!

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.780
Are you alright, Tomoe?

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:12.330
Yes.

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:19.070
In that case...

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:22.010
Shit!

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.270
Kanui-sama.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.320
Kanui-sama?

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:33.750
Kanui-sama! Kanui-sama!!

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:37.120
Take this...

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:43.360
I'm leaving things... in your hands.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.890
Hurry to the storage room!

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:00.090
Yes, Tomoe-sama!

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.880
Loyal patriotism for ruler and country!

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:12.610
Those who oppose the Masakado shrine warrior priestesses...

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:15.200
I won't let them have their way!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:29.000
What?

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.040
What is that?

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:43.800
The forbidden Demonic Ninja Toad technique!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:45.120
This is madness!

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:48.260
They... they won't be able to return to being human!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:51.010
Those Demonic Ninja have now become true demons.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.690
They are no longer afraid of something like death.

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:57.270
You... you're the current leader?

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:59.060
Behold the ultimate form. {Is this a trap?}

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:03.520
I have resurrected the Demonic Ninja Clan that you threw away.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.440
You're disgusting.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.080
Watch out!

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:33.630
Tomoe-sama, you have no choice but to preform Nadeshiko!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:35.000
We're out of options!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:35.930
But...!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:39.230
Tomoe-sama! Tomoe-sama!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:45.270
Tomoe-sama!

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:48.650
Nadeshiko! {Wow this show is unique ain't it?}

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:50.900
Full power!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:52.110
Blossom!

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.310
Forward!

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:11.470
Just give it up, idiot!

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:15.760
If you let those officials run Hinomoto, they will lead it to ruin!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:28.150
The only goals of the Demonic Ninja are to find new techniques and new battlefields.

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:32.570
Even if Hinomoto falls, we can just move to another country.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:35.650
How far can our skills take us, I wonder?

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:38.440
How much can we continue to improve?

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:40.660
The path of the ninja is one of destruction.

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:45.130
How could I possibly lose to someone who strayed from their path?

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.160
What's so funny?

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:51.420
You...

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.130
are the same as me.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:57.890
However, that is why you will never be able to defeat her!

00:15:58.260 --> 00:15:59.350
You bitch!

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:13.860
Holy Serpent...

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.760
If only I had great skill...

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:23.370
If only I had great skill...

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.400
If only I could master those skills...

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.250
I thought I could make a difference.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:32.300
As the leader of the Demonic Ninja, I vowed never to stray from the path of destruction!

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:34.300
But...

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:38.350
Shit. Shit. Shit!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.640
I don't understand! Why?

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:44.790
I'm supposed to be the strongest warrior!

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.060
Why can't I win?

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:53.150
All warriors have a wall they must climb over.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.880
Once someone finds their own reason to fight,

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:59.030
that's when they change from a fighter to a warrior.

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.840
Tomoe-sama...

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:30.480
Shi-

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:42.180
Tomoe-sama!

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:04.100
Hang in there! Hold on...!

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:08.350
Hey, Tomoe-sama...

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.020
Queen's Blade...

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:16.740
Tomoe-sama... you'll win, won't you?

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:19.610
Without fail.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:22.170
My only regret...

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:29.540
was not being able to see Tomoe-sama's true abilities...

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.410
Thank you.

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:41.530
Give me...

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.420
Give unto me...

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:47.750
The power to avenge my country!

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:55.940
Holy Serpent, to battle!

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:01.030
The fatal technique of the warrior priestess...

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:02.890
Decapitation!

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.580
For the sake of the country, huh?

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:25.260
I couldn't accept those beautiful words... even in the end...

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:29.640
You're wrong.

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:33.440
She isn't fighting for something like that.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.930
Please rest in peace...

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:41.960
In peace...

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.560
I will not cry!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:46.660
Hinomoto...

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:50.080
I will save it!

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:51.620
Hinomoto!

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.180
I...!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.250
I...!

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:07.470
Tomoe isn't fighting for the country.

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:12.910
She is fighting for those precious to her.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.920
That's why Tomoe is strong.

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:21.860
Let's go together...

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.400
If I fight alongside of you...

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.820
I think I can become strong, too.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.880
